  "details": "Hello,\n\nI don´t know where else to post this, reddit removed it instantly.\n\nFirst I want to say I love VRChat and i like the new accessories.\n\nBut I think for some time the prices in the shop for items and bundles are too expensive, especially compared to similar items and accessories u can buy from external sites and then add to your avatar in unity.\n\nWich requires similar skill levels for the person putting them on.\n\nI think the value and quality for what u pay is not there. I would really like to buy them to support VRChat but i feel like i wasted my money on overly expensive gimmicks and feel some resentment for some earlier purchases i made.\n\n25€ for 4 items in the Good and Evil Bundle\n\nand\n\n20€ for 4 items in the fluffy Bundle.\n\nthese are almost full external site avatar prices.",
